$ skills guard-hook
# tool_name of the wrong type with a denied command
--- stdin ---
{"tool_name":7,"tool_input":{"command":"labdrian skills approve"}}
--- exit ---
0
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---

$ skills guard-hook
